    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional two bedroom dual aspect duplex apartment with a south facing balcony ideally located along the banks of The River Camac.\r\n\r\nThis superb property features an entrance hall with laminate floors and a hotpress. The downstairs double bedroom boasts sophisticated fitted wardrobes, comfy carpet flooring and access to a south facing balcony. The stylish generous sized bathroom comes with a tiled floor, partially tiled walls, built-in storage and a towel radiator. The light filled open plan living room & dining area enjoys high ceilings, laminate floors, understairs storage, wall mounted shelving and floor to ceiling windows overlooking The River Camac. The fully integrated high spec L shaped kitchen has a tiled floor, splashback tiling and plenty of counter & cupboard space. The upstairs bedroom has space for a home office, laminate floors, fitted wardrobes and access to a communal rooftop terrace. This stunning property also benefits from a secure underground designated car space.\r\n\r\nRivercourt is ideally located in Inchicore with plenty of amenities close by such as shops, cafes, restaurants and bars. The LUAS makes the city centre easily accessible, and the Grand Canal makes for a lovely stroll. The Phoenix Park, Memorial Gardens and Royal Hospital all provide excellent leisure facilities. The new children's hospital at St. James's is also within walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Year of construction 1999\r\nService charge €1970\r\nNo rent caps\r\nDual aspect\r\nSouth facing balcony\r\nCommunal rooftop terrace\r\nDesignated car space\r\nHigh ceilings\r\nRiver views\r\nStylish interior"
      },
